This package contains Fontreal activation scripts, the per-user O/K3
preference command, and build records. The preference does not enable
treatment or upgrade a saved renderer. The startup hook exports the
choice only after the existing enabled-marker and exact-runtime checks.
It does not include Qt libraries or font files. Patched Qt packages retain
their upstream licenses and corresponding-source obligations.
